This application combines KH1 v2 and KH2 v9 archive workflows with a German
Tkinter interface. The KH1 importer accepts the German Rikux3 source and the
Japanese TieuLink .kh1pcpatch format. The KH2 importer accepts German or
Japanese .kh2pcpatch voice mods, plus the separately selected supported Steam
movie pack. No game, voice, movie, or external mod media is included.

KH1 German mod:
https://github.com/Rikux3/kh1fm-undub-ger-pc
KH1 Japanese voices by TieuLink:
https://www.nexusmods.com/kingdomheartsfinalmix/mods/6
KH2 German voices and movies by TieuLink:
https://www.nexusmods.com/kingdomhearts2finalmix/mods/42
KH2 Japanese voices by TieuLink:
https://www.nexusmods.com/kingdomhearts2finalmix/mods/16

These links are credits and download references only. No mod assets are
redistributed, and this package grants no rights in the game or mod content.
KINGDOM HEARTS belongs to its respective owners. See engine-specific NOTICE
files for upstream code and archive-format attributions.

On Windows, missing or unusable FFmpeg tools are downloaded from Gyan.dev to
this application's bin directory. The pinned FFmpeg 9.0.2 Essentials package
is a separate GPLv3-or-later distribution. Its SHA-256 is checked before
installation, and its upstream LICENSE and README are saved alongside the
programs. No FFmpeg binary is included in this source package.
